---
import { Phone } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section class="text-center">
  <h1
    class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-heading font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight">
    How many jobs are you losing just because no one called fast enough?
  </h1>
  <p
    class="text-lg md:text-xl mt-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
    <span class="font-bold text-black">
      I've tested over 1,500+ Google Local Services Ads by submitting real
      inquiries.
    </span>{" "}
    In nearly every case, <span class="font-bold text-black">
      no one called me back
    </span>. Google's automated SMS was immediate, but the human follow-up
    call—if it came at all, was hours or days later. Our A.I voice agent will
    answer your phone or call your leads in under 6 seconds, qualify, and
    schedule an estimate before your competitor see's the notification.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center">
    <a
      href="/booking"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-md font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors">
      Book a 15-min blueprint call
      <Phone class="w-5 h-5" />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
